      <title>Apple Watch, Oura Ring, iPhone Duo: Best Tech Gifts for Holiday 2026</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/apple-watch-oura-ring-iphone-duo-best-tech-gifts-for-holiday-2026</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">61df152e0d1b7fcfa9372ae1</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:30:02 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>With holiday shopping now in full swing, many consumers are being bombarded with the “best deals” for devices and gadgets they might have little need for, and it’s all too easy to be lured into impulse purchases. Black Friday and the trove of other discounts landing over the next few weeks are often an excellent opportunity to buy products like wireless headphones, a bigger and brighter TV or perhaps even a new smartphone.</description>
